  "name": "Photo Series: Singaporean Architecture",
  "summary": "\u003cp\u003eIn another attempt at post-shooting photo series creation, I have put together a\ncollection of architecture shots I took during my brief stay in Singapore in\nJune of 2018.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/8908/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/8908/8908.avif\"\n         title=\"Singaporean Architecture 01\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"8908\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e",
  "content": "\u003cp\u003eIn another attempt at post-shooting photo series creation, I have put together a\ncollection of architecture shots I took during my brief stay in Singapore in\nJune of 2018.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/8908/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/8908/8908.avif\"\n         title=\"Singaporean Architecture 01\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"8908\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/9004/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/9004/9004.avif\"\n         title=\"Singaporean Architecture 02\"\n         alt=\"A small sections of a modern building, with lots of glass, some pillars and thin beams connecting them, black and white\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"9004\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/9002/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/9002/9002.avif\"\n         title=\"Singaporean Architecture 03\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"9002\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/9003/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/9003/9003.avif\"\n         title=\"Singaporean Architecture 04\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"9003\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/9005/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/9005/9005.avif\"\n         title=\"Singaporean Architecture 05\"\n         alt=\"A footbridge between two sections of a large residential building, black and white\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"9005\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/9009/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/9009/9009.avif\"\n         title=\"Singaporean Architecture 05\"\n         alt=\"Part of a large modernist building with many pillars, white panels and wide strips of windows angled downwards, in black and white\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"9009\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/8912/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/8912/8912.avif\"\n         title=\"Singaporean Architecture 07\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"999\"\n\t\t id=\"8912\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/8909/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/8909/8909.avif\"\n         title=\"Singaporean Architecture 08\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"8909\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e",
